 resubmitted"},{"title":"QPA/2024/01564 - Aleksandar Gligorov - Reference Letter","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-29","description":"The reference letter is not valid. Please submit a reference letter from a financial institution dated within the last six months confirming that the person is a valid customer.","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:07]"},{"title":"Financial Projections","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-29","description":"The GGR and NGR figures provided in the financial projections are unclear. Kindly clarify why NGR is at times lower and other times higher than GGR. Furthermore, the projections do not include a cashflow statement and balance sheet. Please update the projections accordingly.","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:10]"},{"title":"Domain ownership","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-29","description":"Most of the registered domains refer to a Costa Rica entity EOD Code SRL, with no apparent license, when accessed through a Netherlands IP address, even though MIBS N.V.'s terms and conditions state that the Netherlands is a prohibited jurisdiction. Furthermore, it was noted that a few of the domains registered under MIBS N.V. refer to other entities in the site footer. For example, luckyblock.com refers to Igloo Ventures SRL, another Costa Rica entity, as the site owner/operator, seemingly an Anjouan licensed entity, however upon logging in it refers to Entretenimiento Rojo B.V., which is another GCB license applicant. Please ensure that all domains registered with the GCB correspond to MIBS N.V.","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:11]"},{"title":"AML Policy (duplicate ticket)","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-09-09","description":"It was noted on most of the registered sites that there is an AML policy available, however this makes reference to EU AML directives. The AML policy must be compliant with Curacao AML laws.","notes":"Update: 9/16/2025 Anti-money Laundering Policy. Duplicate Ticket. This ticket is now closed."},{"title":"Responsible Gaming","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-29","description":"The RG policy available on the domains only mentions self-exclusion as an available RG tool (in some of the sites not even that). Users must be able to self-exclude and also set session time limits and loss limits through their profile settings.","notes":"1/12/2025 No policy uploaded."},{"title":"Technical Setup","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-09-29","description":"The Business Plan lacks information regarding the company's technical setup. Please upload as an annex to the Business Plan.","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:11]"}]},{"name":"Responsible Gaming","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"ID verification procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"ID verification procedure","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:12]"},{"title":"Account closure procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Account closure procedure upon the operator becoming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:12]"},{"title":"Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Record-keeping","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:13]"},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:13] Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:13]"},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:13]"},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:13]"},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:14]"},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:14]"},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:14]"},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:14]"},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:15]"},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:15]"},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:15]"},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:16]"},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:16]"},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:17]"},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:17]"},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-05-14","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:18]"},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:18]"},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-14","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:19]"},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-14","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":"Closed due to rejection. [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 12-05-2026 16:19]"}]}]}]}